Tab5 native Bluetooth Classic / A2DP demo
Put headphones in pairing mode, then: a2dp pair
After streaming starts: a2dp tone 440
a2dp tone off | a2dp status | a2dp stop
Reconnect a bonded device: a2dp connect
Select explicitly: a2dp peer AABBCCDDEEFF, then a2dp connect pair
Discovery: a2dp find | Boot reconnect: a2dp auto 1
Stop the link before resetting or flashing. Type help to repeat.␀␀Command too long; discarded.␀␀␀␀a2dp␀␀␀␀demo_ui␀W (%lu) %s: Command queue full
